   "body": "Unblocked by #1043 (merged as 3d0768817b9b4963c10935fb22d682e1881b8dbe).\n\nStep 1 is done: `tooling/legacy-oracle/samples/legacy-stores/rehost-images.archive` (3 images; images 2 and 3 hold synthetic states no legacy writer produces, see the MANIFEST note) and `rehost-images-empty.archive` (the last-delete case), both written by the unmodified `RehostImage.m` @ 87fe0d1c with the same `NSKeyedArchiver` call. Step 2, the import into the upload history, is cloud work: what the importer must decode is in the MANIFEST #967 note (archived `NSNull` in the medium fields, numeric width and height, nil fields, `deleted`).\n\nmac/M1 releases its claim:\n/release mac/M1\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
